 "kind": "module",
 "source": "HC-SR04 ultrasonic ranging module data sheet (Cytron / ElecFreaks): PCB 45 x 20 mm, overall 45 x 20 x 15 mm, two 16 mm transducers (TX and RX) at 26 mm centre spacing, 4-pin 2.54 mm header (VCC, Trig, Echo, GND). ASSUMED / uncertain: PCB thickness 1.2 mm; transducers centred across the 20 mm width and symmetric about the board centre along the length (9.5 / 35.5 mm); transducer housing 16.0 mm dia (the cans are 16.2 mm on some clones); no mounting holes (vendor variants have none); the 4-pin header on the back (-Z) at the middle of the -Y long edge, body 2.5 mm with pins at the 2.54 pitch; front face of the transducers 15.0 mm above the PCB bottom including the PCB (datasheet overall height).",
 "frame": "module: origin at the PCB min corner, PCB bottom at Z = 0, transducers look toward +Z, header on the underside at the -Y edge",
 "params": {
  "pcb_length": {
   "default": 45.0,
   "source": "datasheet: board length"
  },
  "pcb_width": {
   "default": 20.0,
   "source": "datasheet: board width"
  },
  "pcb_thickness": {
   "default": 1.2,
   "source": "assumed PCB thickness"
  },
