 "connectors": [],
 "notes": "No mounting holes: the module is held by ribs/clips at the PCB edge or by a pocket behind the transducers (the cans 16.0 mm dia stand about 13.8 mm above the PCB top). The two apertures TRANSDUCERS must be open through the front wall (a hole per transducer, diameter transducer_diameter + 2 mm margin; the transducer front can sit flush in or poke through the opening); a single wide slot over both is also accepted. The header position/side is the least certain datum: some clones have the header on the front, so the owner's unit must be checked before a wire exit is committed. Import gate: R1 bbox 45 x 20 x 17.5 (the 15 mm datasheet height plus the 2.5 mm header body assumed on the back; datasheet_size = total_height + header_body_height; tol 0.3); R2 spacing 26 mm; R9 skipped.",
 "self_checks": [
  {
   "name": "R2 transducer spacing",
   "expr": "TRANSDUCERS[1].x - TRANSDUCERS[0].x",
   "value": 26.0,
   "tol": 0.05
  },
  {
   "name": "R2 transducer diameter",
   "expr": "TRANSDUCERS.diameter",
   "value": 16.0,
   "tol": 0.3
  },
  {
